  "notes": "Super Smash 2026-27, its final season before NZ20 (NZC, 12 Oct 2026: https://www.nzc.nz/super-smash-back-to-where-it-began/ (full schedule: https://www.nzc.nz/media/jtgfd3gt/super-smash-schedule-2627.pdf)): 27 Dec 2026 - 30 Jan 2027, the same six teams, 10 rounds of 10 games each (every team plays the others twice), then the Elimination Final (2nd v 3rd, 28 Jan) and the Grand Final (1st v its winner, 30 Jan), both at Kennards Hire Community Oval, Auckland, rather than at the higher team's home. Otago's teams are listed as Volts and Sparks. CricketData named last season \"Super Smash 2025-26\" and its teams by association (Auckland, Northern Knights or Northern Districts, Central Districts), which the aliases cover."
